<title>PHILIPPINES: Metro Pacific falls 10.61 pct.</title>
<headline>Metro Pacific falls 10.61 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding firm Metro Pacific Corp fell sharply in early trade in tandem with the rest of the market which plunged on poor first quarter earnings expectations on blue chip issues, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Metro Pacific just went along with the pack,&quot; Warren Chua, an analyst of Angping Securities, said.</p>
<p>Metro Pacific announced a doubling of its first quarter net income last week.</p>
<p>Chua said fears over its property projects might also have added to the selling pressure.</p>
<p>-- MANILA NEWSROOM (63 2) 841-8938 Fax 817-6267</p>
